(2560306, 353360, 53147, '<td valign="top">LOL - Now a smile and hearty laugh came across me as I opened this up, and I know personally that she will be totally stunned and amazed to see that she has had an influence to this degree. I promise not to tell her ahead of time and let her come across it all on her own. Great idea, although I think you should have stuck with the apple alone. But the candy does bring in a good mix of color. Good luck on this one (and I look forward to seeing who is trying to charm my wife - lol).</td>', 'LOL - Now a smile and hearty laugh came across me as I opened this up, and I know personally that she will be totally stunned and amazed to see that she has had an influence to this degree. I promise not to tell her ahead of time and let her come across it all on her own. Great idea, although I think you should have stuck with the apple alone. But the candy does bring in a good mix of color. Good luck on this one (and I look forward to seeing who is trying to charm my wife - lol).', '2006-06-28 01:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
