(2561548, 353075, 16197, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t sell to me that it is haunted or even all that spooky.  To me just a kid in a room. Even looks like something around his neck, which makes him look touristy.  At least the effects round the chandeler are nice.</td>', 'Doesn''t sell to me that it is haunted or even all that spooky.  To me just a kid in a room. Even looks like something around his neck, which makes him look touristy.  At least the effects round the chandeler are nice.', '2006-06-28 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
