(2561950, 354744, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the square frame of the shot, but think I would have liked it even more if the coin (the main subject of the photo) was off-center, like along one of the "thirds".  You maybe could have acheived such an effect by shooting this from a lower angle and closer in so you''re not looking top-down onto the hand and could therefore use the angles of the fingers to "pull" you into the main area of interest.  Excellent idea though and I love that you presented this in black &amp; white. :)</td>', 'I really like the square frame of the shot, but think I would have liked it even more if the coin (the main subject of the photo) was off-center, like along one of the "thirds".  You maybe could have acheived such an effect by shooting this from a lower angle and closer in so you''re not looking top-down onto the hand and could therefore use the angles of the fingers to "pull" you into the main area of interest.  Excellent idea though and I love that you presented this in black & white. :)', '2006-06-28 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
