(2562010, 354743, 16197, '<td valign="top">Love this concept.  Great way to Re-create a fairy tale.  Oh wait, its not a superstition or Urban legend... Hmmmm. But very nice all the same.</td>', 'Love this concept.  Great way to Re-create a fairy tale.  Oh wait, its not a superstition or Urban legend... Hmmmm. But very nice all the same.', '2006-06-28 12:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2562014, 354731, 16197, '<td valign="top">This almost works. But the stake is a little hard to see at first glance.  Personaly I would have made it more promenite in the image, seein on how it is the ''killer''.</td>', 'This almost works. But the stake is a little hard to see at first glance.  Personaly I would have made it more promenite in the image, seein on how it is the ''killer''.', '2006-06-28 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2562020, 354557, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very fun dof on this image.  with the red pins and single black also very fun. but, maybe a more humoniod shape L()L.  but its fun.  But, its not really a superstition or a Urban legend, more of a religion.</td>', 'Very fun dof on this image.  with the red pins and single black also very fun. but, maybe a more humoniod shape L()L.  but its fun.  But, its not really a superstition or a Urban legend, more of a religion.', '2006-06-28 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2562021, 353552, 57202, '<td valign="top">While you have captured some of the throwing "motion" in the hand, I think the setting might hurt you here.  While McDonald''s is certainly a great place to get salt :), the overall setting is a bit distracting from the main subject of the shot.  My personal general rule of thumb is to try and shoot in as simple an atmosphere as possible (i.e. usually one overall color in the background or shot with a tight DOF to blur the background out).  Also, I personally think the shot would have had more impact if we could see the salt actually being thrown (hopefully not right at the camera ;) ) and possibly freeze it in midair with a flash. :)  Great idea though!</td>', 'While you have captured some of the throwing "motion" in the hand, I think the setting might hurt you here.  While McDonald''s is certainly a great place to get salt :), the overall setting is a bit distracting from the main subject of the shot.  My personal general rule of thumb is to try and shoot in as simple an atmosphere as possible (i.e. usually one overall color in the background or shot with a tight DOF to blur the background out).  Also, I personally think the shot would have had more impact if we could see the salt actually being thrown (hopefully not right at the camera ;) ) and possibly freeze it in midair with a flash. :)  Great idea though!', '2006-06-28 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2562027, 353551, 16197, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if I would call this an urban legend, but for the sake of argument, ok.  A wider angle lense with not showing the ropes in the forground would make this a stronger image.  I like the Tow away sign, but, maybe something tighter in the crop so not to see there is only a hadfull of people watching.</td>', 'Don''t know if I would call this an urban legend, but for the sake of argument, ok.  A wider angle lense with not showing the ropes in the forground would make this a stronger image.  I like the Tow away sign, but, maybe something tighter in the crop so not to see there is only a hadfull of people watching.', '2006-06-28 13:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2562029, 353075, 59194, '<td valign="top">What makes this image haunted?  I see some abberations near the chandelier but I''m not getting a haunted feeling.</td>', 'What makes this image haunted?  I see some abberations near the chandelier but I''m not getting a haunted feeling.', '2006-06-28 13:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
