(2562187, 352873, 35602, '<td valign="top">For me it is snakes or spiders.  We actually did have a snake come out of the faucet once when it was droughty.  Back then, our faucets were bigger and there was no screen on it to prevent things from crawling out.</td>', 'For me it is snakes or spiders.  We actually did have a snake come out of the faucet once when it was droughty.  Back then, our faucets were bigger and there was no screen on it to prevent things from crawling out.', '2006-06-28 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
