(2563255, 354411, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m sure others are going to say it.  Look up the tutorial for resizing shots.  Small shots like this always get a low score, so don''t let the score get you down on this one.  The lighting is harsh on this one and the applicability to the challenge is quite subtle.  The separation of church and state is a myth?</td>', 'I''m sure others are going to say it.  Look up the tutorial for resizing shots.  Small shots like this always get a low score, so don''t let the score get you down on this one.  The lighting is harsh on this one and the applicability to the challenge is quite subtle.  The separation of church and state is a myth?', '2006-06-28 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
