(2563354, 354256, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done that it looks like something (a heart). Could be love in your future.  I sorta wish there was a great deal more DOF.  I don''t like the blurry side of the cup.  A tip, if you are just doing the shot for DPC is to take advantage of the 640 px size.  You can hold the camera quite a bit back and then crop later.  This gives your camera much more apparent DOF with the same aperture.<br/> <br/>Of course not knowing who this is, I may be talking to a ribbon winner, in which case, forget I said anything. ;) 7</td>', 'Very nicely done that it looks like something (a heart). Could be love in your future.  I sorta wish there was a great deal more DOF.  I don''t like the blurry side of the cup.  A tip, if you are just doing the shot for DPC is to take advantage of the 640 px size.  You can hold the camera quite a bit back and then crop later.  This gives your camera much more apparent DOF with the same aperture. Of course not knowing who this is, I may be talking to a ribbon winner, in which case, forget I said anything. ;) 7', '2006-06-28 18:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
