(2564039, 354598, 40718, '<td valign="top">Also an effective spermicide. Not.  I think it is a creative idea, but I don''t like the blown nature of the background.  It''s odd, parts of the can look razor sharp, but there seems to be a soft patch where the C-swoop goes through the L. 6</td>', 'Also an effective spermicide. Not.  I think it is a creative idea, but I don''t like the blown nature of the background.  It''s odd, parts of the can look razor sharp, but there seems to be a soft patch where the C-swoop goes through the L. 6', '2006-06-28 21:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564042, 354660, 40718, '<td valign="top">This should do well.  I prefer this version over the other entry.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'This should do well.  I prefer this version over the other entry.  Nicely done. 8', '2006-06-28 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564046, 354674, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  I''m guessing glass instead of a mirror, but the extra ear on the left has me a bit bamboozled.  A bit high key for my taste.  His shoulders are blending with the background. 7  Ok, I''m just a bit slow today.  A mirror, but just taken at an angle and rotated.  Duh...</td>', 'Nice effect.  I''m guessing glass instead of a mirror, but the extra ear on the left has me a bit bamboozled.  A bit high key for my taste.  His shoulders are blending with the background. 7  Ok, I''m just a bit slow today.  A mirror, but just taken at an angle and rotated.  Duh...', '2006-06-28 21:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564055, 354377, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think this qualifies as a superstition instead of a proverb unlike some other entries.  Nice subtle colors.  We don''t need hyperreality every day.  Is this Bear?  He likes subtle colors, but I haven''t seen him do a lighthouse before.  I''m not sure I like the tree on the right. 6</td>', 'I think this qualifies as a superstition instead of a proverb unlike some other entries.  Nice subtle colors.  We don''t need hyperreality every day.  Is this Bear?  He likes subtle colors, but I haven''t seen him do a lighthouse before.  I''m not sure I like the tree on the right. 6', '2006-06-28 21:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
