(2564253, 353123, 56254, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry</td>', 'a bit blurry', '2006-06-28 23:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564254, 354087, 59130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I''d prefer to see the salt in better definition - since there is very little to look at in the picture, what there is needs to be attention-grabbing.  Unfortunately the salt looks like a white blob mostly, with grainy bits around the edges.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I''d prefer to see the salt in better definition - since there is very little to look at in the picture, what there is needs to be attention-grabbing.  Unfortunately the salt looks like a white blob mostly, with grainy bits around the edges.', '2006-06-28 23:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564257, 353449, 59130, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see a face in the top left corner, but it''s not a very appealing image. Without the title it wouldn''t work very well.  Nice idea though</td>', 'Yes, I can see a face in the top left corner, but it''s not a very appealing image. Without the title it wouldn''t work very well.  Nice idea though', '2006-06-28 23:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564262, 352354, 59130, '<td valign="top">I can''t see any jumping - perhaps the photo is a little too dark?  Nice idea but I can''t really make out what it is - it almost looks like a sunrise.</td>', 'I can''t see any jumping - perhaps the photo is a little too dark?  Nice idea but I can''t really make out what it is - it almost looks like a sunrise.', '2006-06-28 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564264, 353571, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like it, but realistically, the leash wouldn''t be on the table.  Plus, I''d have used a real meaty dish, such as stir fry beef.</td>', 'I like it, but realistically, the leash wouldn''t be on the table.  Plus, I''d have used a real meaty dish, such as stir fry beef.', '2006-06-28 23:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564265, 354676, 51750, '<td valign="top">The photo quality is great, but i dont like this composition at all.</td>', 'The photo quality is great, but i dont like this composition at all.', '2006-06-28 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564270, 354550, 59130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think you could have done it better.  I don''t think the black background complements the shell very well - it would be nicer on a beach in sunshine for example.  The shell looks a little anaemic somehow - could you have boosted the colour a bit?  There are also a couple of distracting bright pixels (bottom left and right under the shell).  Final point - I think it would look better with a little "negative space" to the left of the shell - it would focus the eye on the most attractive part of the shell and add some impact to the picture.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think you could have done it better.  I don''t think the black background complements the shell very well - it would be nicer on a beach in sunshine for example.  The shell looks a little anaemic somehow - could you have boosted the colour a bit?  There are also a couple of distracting bright pixels (bottom left and right under the shell).  Final point - I think it would look better with a little "negative space" to the left of the shell - it would focus the eye on the most attractive part of the shell and add some impact to the picture.', '2006-06-28 23:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564271, 353552, 59130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I''m sure you could have done it better - it isn''t a very attractive shot, and it isn''t very interesting either.  The salt on the shoulder looks like dandruff!  Nice try though</td>', 'Nice idea, but I''m sure you could have done it better - it isn''t a very attractive shot, and it isn''t very interesting either.  The salt on the shoulder looks like dandruff!  Nice try though', '2006-06-28 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2564273, 354697, 56254, '<td valign="top">very well done!</td>', 'very well done!', '2006-06-28 23:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
