(2564277, 354719, 59130, '<td valign="top">A better effort than some of the similar ones in the contest.  I think the grains are a little over-sharpened, but I do like it.  I like the glint on the silver top.</td>', 'A better effort than some of the similar ones in the contest.  I think the grains are a little over-sharpened, but I do like it.  I like the glint on the silver top.', '2006-06-28 23:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
