(2566574, 352354, 46314, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for here, but unfortunately you didn''t quite get the exposure right. I comes out a bit dull and flat. Probably worth trying again though...</td>', 'I can see what you were going for here, but unfortunately you didn''t quite get the exposure right. I comes out a bit dull and flat. Probably worth trying again though...', '2006-06-29 15:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566576, 354378, 58048, '<td valign="top">This is probably the nost used superstition on this challenge... But the compo of this one is not bad... 6</td>', 'This is probably the nost used superstition on this challenge... But the compo of this one is not bad... 6', '2006-06-29 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566577, 354598, 58048, '<td valign="top">Urban legend, indeed. Good idea and good shot. 7</td>', 'Urban legend, indeed. Good idea and good shot. 7', '2006-06-29 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566579, 353907, 42100, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether to laugh or cry at this one and what is going on in your mind to come up with this idea.  Very funny and a good photo.  The selective desat works well here.</td>', 'I don''t know whether to laugh or cry at this one and what is going on in your mind to come up with this idea.  Very funny and a good photo.  The selective desat works well here.', '2006-06-29 15:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566580, 354316, 44579, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors and crop. 8.</td>', 'Amazing colors and crop. 8.', '2006-06-29 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566581, 354733, 46314, '<td valign="top">Good humour. The focus is a bit off though, and the lighting could be improved (shadows seem a bit distracting).</td>', 'Good humour. The focus is a bit off though, and the lighting could be improved (shadows seem a bit distracting).', '2006-06-29 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566584, 354340, 58048, '<td valign="top">Nice compo but I''m really suspicious about the editing on this one... The red eyes, the light halo... Anyway it seems to have been validated so i give you 8.</td>', 'Nice compo but I''m really suspicious about the editing on this one... The red eyes, the light halo... Anyway it seems to have been validated so i give you 8.', '2006-06-29 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566585, 354342, 42100, '<td valign="top">Pretty creepy.  How you got the skin so pale looking is really what makes your theme work well.  Very nice!</td>', 'Pretty creepy.  How you got the skin so pale looking is really what makes your theme work well.  Very nice!', '2006-06-29 15:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566586, 353551, 46314, '<td valign="top">The ropes create a very weird perspective effect. I think they tend to confuse the viewer a bit, which might distract from the action.</td>', 'The ropes create a very weird perspective effect. I think they tend to confuse the viewer a bit, which might distract from the action.', '2006-06-29 15:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566587, 353932, 58048, '<td valign="top">Scary... Very sharp, good contrasts. 8</td>', 'Scary... Very sharp, good contrasts. 8', '2006-06-29 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566589, 354674, 58048, '<td valign="top">Nice compo... How did you do it? 7</td>', 'Nice compo... How did you do it? 7', '2006-06-29 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566591, 354430, 46314, '<td valign="top">Is that a superstition, or a proverb? Anyway, as far as the photo goes, I think the lighting is a bit harsh, and the composition is a bit snapshottish. Weird eye that dog has, eh?</td>', 'Is that a superstition, or a proverb? Anyway, as far as the photo goes, I think the lighting is a bit harsh, and the composition is a bit snapshottish. Weird eye that dog has, eh?', '2006-06-29 15:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566592, 354316, 58048, '<td valign="top">Where is the superstition/urban legend theme here? Too bad because it was a pretty nice picture however... 6</td>', 'Where is the superstition/urban legend theme here? Too bad because it was a pretty nice picture however... 6', '2006-06-29 15:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566596, 352523, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very bizarre. But I like the way you think... Unfortunately, I just think that you should have gone for a more abstract angle. Right now, this comes across like a photo of a person in a motorcycle helmet, with christmas lights on him. Rather than the "alien" concept that I know you were going for. Maybe a much tighter crop from a weird angle would have made the subject less recognisable, and therefore more mysterious.</td>', 'Very bizarre. But I like the way you think... Unfortunately, I just think that you should have gone for a more abstract angle. Right now, this comes across like a photo of a person in a motorcycle helmet, with christmas lights on him. Rather than the "alien" concept that I know you were going for. Maybe a much tighter crop from a weird angle would have made the subject less recognisable, and therefore more mysterious.', '2006-06-29 15:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566599, 354740, 46314, '<td valign="top">The lighting is smooth, but ultimately a bit flat. And due to the DOF, there are bits out of focus in key areas that I find a bit distracting.</td>', 'The lighting is smooth, but ultimately a bit flat. And due to the DOF, there are bits out of focus in key areas that I find a bit distracting.', '2006-06-29 15:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566606, 354340, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting colouring and lighting. Gives it a really ominous feel.</td>', 'Interesting colouring and lighting. Gives it a really ominous feel.', '2006-06-29 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566608, 354218, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. The only minor distraction is that light shining in the background. Still, great shot.</td>', 'Very well executed. The only minor distraction is that light shining in the background. Still, great shot.', '2006-06-29 15:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566609, 353442, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The monochrome look was a good choice too.</td>', 'Nicely done. The monochrome look was a good choice too.', '2006-06-29 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566611, 354723, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very interesting way of showing this concept, but overall not the most exciting photo to look at. Might have some stock value though.</td>', 'Very interesting way of showing this concept, but overall not the most exciting photo to look at. Might have some stock value though.', '2006-06-29 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566613, 353075, 46314, '<td valign="top">Feels a bit out of focus and a the lighting seems a bit flat - just doesn''t create an eerie atmosphere like I''d want it to.</td>', 'Feels a bit out of focus and a the lighting seems a bit flat - just doesn''t create an eerie atmosphere like I''d want it to.', '2006-06-29 15:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566615, 354653, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. Good idea to have the dark underexposure to make the surroundings look more sewer-like.</td>', 'Funny idea. Good idea to have the dark underexposure to make the surroundings look more sewer-like.', '2006-06-29 15:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566617, 353995, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Just doesn''t seem to grab me though.</td>', 'Nice capture. Just doesn''t seem to grab me though.', '2006-06-29 15:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566619, 354028, 46314, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop? That light plug switch is unnecessary. But nice idea. Umbrella is a bizarre touch that I like. And the diagonal lines bring a bit of uneasiness.</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop? That light plug switch is unnecessary. But nice idea. Umbrella is a bizarre touch that I like. And the diagonal lines bring a bit of uneasiness.', '2006-06-29 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566623, 353887, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lol. Funny idea. But the photo is a bit too much of a snapshot - bit out of focus, not much colour. Simply not enough impact.</td>', 'Lol. Funny idea. But the photo is a bit too much of a snapshot - bit out of focus, not much colour. Simply not enough impact.', '2006-06-29 15:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566667, 354761, 34337, '<td valign="top">This is really funny.  The photo could be a little sharper, etc, but it really made me smile.</td>', 'This is really funny.  The photo could be a little sharper, etc, but it really made me smile.', '2006-06-29 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566677, 354196, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of the gem, but the clovers and the band of the ring seem to be a bit dark.  I like the way you used the DOF to bring focus to the main subject of the shot though.</td>', 'I like the clarity of the gem, but the clovers and the band of the ring seem to be a bit dark.  I like the way you used the DOF to bring focus to the main subject of the shot though.', '2006-06-29 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566679, 353337, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition. :)  The detail on the fingers is awesome!  The only thing I can point out is that it seems a bit too bright and maybe needed a slight levels adjustment.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition. :)  The detail on the fingers is awesome!  The only thing I can point out is that it seems a bit too bright and maybe needed a slight levels adjustment.', '2006-06-29 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566684, 354731, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of this shot. :)  The contrast is also very nice.  However, I''m not quite sure how the title directly relates to a superstition or urban legend (though, being in a graveyard, I could imagine that it probably correlates to one ;) ).  I''m sure the description will make it much more clear.  Sometimes it can be a real pain in the ass to try and convey a complex idea with a title...</td>', 'I really like the angle of this shot. :)  The contrast is also very nice.  However, I''m not quite sure how the title directly relates to a superstition or urban legend (though, being in a graveyard, I could imagine that it probably correlates to one ;) ).  I''m sure the description will make it much more clear.  Sometimes it can be a real pain in the ass to try and convey a complex idea with a title...', '2006-06-29 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566685, 354550, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like that this is an original idea and that no one else attempted this one. :)  My only possible gripe with this shot is that I personally feel a slightly deeper DOF should have been used to bring the whole shell into sharp focus.</td>', 'I like that this is an original idea and that no one else attempted this one. :)  My only possible gripe with this shot is that I personally feel a slightly deeper DOF should have been used to bring the whole shell into sharp focus.', '2006-06-29 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566686, 354378, 57202, '<td valign="top">The best shot with this theme that I''ve seen so far. :)  I like the rich detail and textures.</td>', 'The best shot with this theme that I''ve seen so far. :)  I like the rich detail and textures.', '2006-06-29 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566689, 354298, 57202, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF for this shot!  I really like the rich colors as well. :)</td>', 'Perfect DOF for this shot!  I really like the rich colors as well. :)', '2006-06-29 15:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566691, 354452, 57202, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is very well lit. :)  I like how the green stem on the left seems to fade into the darkness.</td>', 'I think this shot is very well lit. :)  I like how the green stem on the left seems to fade into the darkness.', '2006-06-29 15:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566696, 353125, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent way to tie the themes together! :)  My only possible suggestions for this shot would be to use a much deeper DOF to bring everything into focus and to maybe bring the contrast up just a little.  Great shot though. :)</td>', 'Excellent way to tie the themes together! :)  My only possible suggestions for this shot would be to use a much deeper DOF to bring everything into focus and to maybe bring the contrast up just a little.  Great shot though. :)', '2006-06-29 16:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566697, 354028, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like this original idea and the angle of this shot. :)  I think the black &amp; white really helps add to the ghostly appeal.  Nice job!</td>', 'I really like this original idea and the angle of this shot. :)  I think the black & white really helps add to the ghostly appeal.  Nice job!', '2006-06-29 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566701, 354674, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great photo. :)  My only possible suggestion for improving this would have been to bring the highlights down a bit.</td>', 'Great idea and great photo. :)  My only possible suggestion for improving this would have been to bring the highlights down a bit.', '2006-06-29 16:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566703, 354256, 57202, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF. :)  The lighting you''ve used gives a very "soft" feel to the cup and plate - very nice.</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF. :)  The lighting you''ve used gives a very "soft" feel to the cup and plate - very nice.', '2006-06-29 16:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566704, 352354, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but wish there wasn''t so much darkness and that we could see the ritual up close.</td>', 'I really like the shot, but wish there wasn''t so much darkness and that we could see the ritual up close.', '2006-06-29 16:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566706, 354723, 57202, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF!  Very nice composition as well. :)</td>', 'Perfect DOF!  Very nice composition as well. :)', '2006-06-29 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566707, 352783, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! :)  The gold tone on the rock contrasts very well with the blue tones in the rest of the image.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! :)  The gold tone on the rock contrasts very well with the blue tones in the rest of the image.', '2006-06-29 16:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566737, 354290, 54778, '<td valign="top">A very eye catching pic. It caught my eye from the challenge pic and I ''had'' to click on it. I didn''t have time to vote for this challenge but now I''ll have to cause I want my vote for your pic to count.</td>', 'A very eye catching pic. It caught my eye from the challenge pic and I ''had'' to click on it. I didn''t have time to vote for this challenge but now I''ll have to cause I want my vote for your pic to count.', '2006-06-29 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566749, 354740, 54778, '<td valign="top">I do like this pic but a little more contrast between the white and the orange would have have made the pic sharper.:)</td>', 'I do like this pic but a little more contrast between the white and the orange would have have made the pic sharper.:)', '2006-06-29 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566784, 354316, 16402, '<td valign="top">Colorful and cute but DNMC.</td>', 'Colorful and cute but DNMC.', '2006-06-29 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566788, 354668, 54778, '<td valign="top">I honestly believe you can imrove this pic by changing the angle of your shot. A little to the right would have made the composition more interesting. :)</td>', 'I honestly believe you can imrove this pic by changing the angle of your shot. A little to the right would have made the composition more interesting. :)', '2006-06-29 16:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2566792, 353134, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2006-06-29 16:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
