(2567319, 354775, 35274, '<td valign="top">The blown out shoulder is a bit distracting as well is the graininess of the photo as a whole, but shooting in the dark with a minimal light source tends to do that.</td>', 'The blown out shoulder is a bit distracting as well is the graininess of the photo as a whole, but shooting in the dark with a minimal light source tends to do that.', '2006-06-29 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567324, 354344, 35274, '<td valign="top">I think plane shots always lend some interest, but I think you could have made this a little more dramatic, messing around with contrast and saturation and stuff. Playing around with the "automatic color correction" feature in photoshop (if you have that feature) can really improve shots like this because it removes that slight bluish tint from the clouds, adding more of a color variety. The tilted "horizon" here is a little distracting to me too.</td>', 'I think plane shots always lend some interest, but I think you could have made this a little more dramatic, messing around with contrast and saturation and stuff. Playing around with the "automatic color correction" feature in photoshop (if you have that feature) can really improve shots like this because it removes that slight bluish tint from the clouds, adding more of a color variety. The tilted "horizon" here is a little distracting to me too.', '2006-06-29 19:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567329, 354676, 35274, '<td valign="top">Ribbon winner? I think so! Nice model, excellent DOF and sharpness. I love the colors of this and the lighting seems perfect. 10, good luck!</td>', 'Ribbon winner? I think so! Nice model, excellent DOF and sharpness. I love the colors of this and the lighting seems perfect. 10, good luck!', '2006-06-29 19:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567334, 354028, 35274, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a long exposure. I think the tilted horizon line of the picture adds interest here, although I''m not sure about the composition, as the crop seems a little tight.</td>', 'Nice use of a long exposure. I think the tilted horizon line of the picture adds interest here, although I''m not sure about the composition, as the crop seems a little tight.', '2006-06-29 20:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567337, 353337, 35274, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, though the lighting seems a little harsh to me. And what''s up with that eraser!? haha, looks like it''s melting or something. 7</td>', 'Nice focus, though the lighting seems a little harsh to me. And what''s up with that eraser!? haha, looks like it''s melting or something. 7', '2006-06-29 20:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
