(2567349, 352783, 35274, '<td valign="top">OoOOoooh, nice! Gotta love the long-exposure-river-water shots ;) I''m just not so sure about that golden light cast on the foreground rocks. It seems to stand out too much from the overall cool, blueish tones of the stream. It keeps pulling my eyes toward it, instead of the river. 8</td>', 'OoOOoooh, nice! Gotta love the long-exposure-river-water shots ;) I''m just not so sure about that golden light cast on the foreground rocks. It seems to stand out too much from the overall cool, blueish tones of the stream. It keeps pulling my eyes toward it, instead of the river. 8', '2006-06-29 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2567351, 354697, 40106, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  i like the softness of the skin and the composition.  this definietly would not be as powerful without the selective desat.  great joB! 7</td>', 'cool idea.  i like the softness of the skin and the composition.  this definietly would not be as powerful without the selective desat.  great joB! 7', '2006-06-29 20:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
