(2568365, 354550, 35274, '<td valign="top">This has a nice focus to it, but I think it could have been a bit more interesting with a more loose composition (not so tightly cropped) or make use of the rule of thirds maybe. A natural beach setting and some nice warm light would really make this great, but I understand not many people have access to a beaches.</td>', 'This has a nice focus to it, but I think it could have been a bit more interesting with a more loose composition (not so tightly cropped) or make use of the rule of thirds maybe. A natural beach setting and some nice warm light would really make this great, but I understand not many people have access to a beaches.', '2006-06-30 02:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2568385, 354357, 35274, '<td valign="top">great DOF, and I like the central composition.</td>', 'great DOF, and I like the central composition.', '2006-06-30 02:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2568525, 351967, 59144, '<td valign="top">I love this photo...i love the contrast and the movement of the salt...very powerfully portrayed.  awesome!</td>', 'I love this photo...i love the contrast and the movement of the salt...very powerfully portrayed.  awesome!', '2006-06-30 03:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
