(2569548, 353442, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  Took me a sec to see the "ghostly" fingers.  Nice touch!  Haven''t seen one of these in a while.  Nice choice of theme for your challenge entry.  Overall the image works just fine.  Only nit for me is the top left corner is distracting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ahhh.  Took me a sec to see the "ghostly" fingers.  Nice touch!  Haven''t seen one of these in a while.  Nice choice of theme for your challenge entry.  Overall the image works just fine.  Only nit for me is the top left corner is distracting.  Good luck.', '2006-06-30 13:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569549, 354302, 49315, '<td valign="top">Ummm... I''m not quite to sure of this maybe would of looked better with grass instead of the red material?</td>', 'Ummm... I''m not quite to sure of this maybe would of looked better with grass instead of the red material?', '2006-06-30 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569551, 354350, 49315, '<td valign="top">Oh God i hate those....</td>', 'Oh God i hate those....', '2006-06-30 13:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569555, 354557, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Hope you never get angry with me!!!  ;^)  Fun concept and well executed.  Well positioned composition.  DOF is right on for this image and does a nice job of bleeding out the bg.<br/> <br/>Smile and keep having fun!  ;^)</td>', 'Yikes!  Hope you never get angry with me!!!  ;^)  Fun concept and well executed.  Well positioned composition.  DOF is right on for this image and does a nice job of bleeding out the bg. Smile and keep having fun!  ;^)', '2006-06-30 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569562, 354282, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oooohhh...a water shot!  ;^)  What I want to know is how did you turn around fast enough to get this shot after tossing that coin over your shoulder?  He-he.  This is a nice idea.  Not sure that the wide angle is helping any here.  What I mean is, the subject may have more impact if it was brought in closer and do some major cropping of the surrounding rocks.  JMO of course.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oooohhh...a water shot!  ;^)  What I want to know is how did you turn around fast enough to get this shot after tossing that coin over your shoulder?  He-he.  This is a nice idea.  Not sure that the wide angle is helping any here.  What I mean is, the subject may have more impact if it was brought in closer and do some major cropping of the surrounding rocks.  JMO of course. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-30 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569641, 353571, 40370, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 already, but when I went to tell a friend about it I realized you''ve chosen sushi (typically Japanese cuisine) rather than an item from a Chinese menu, which is what I associate this urban legend with. Oh well, no matter, cause this is still a ribbon in my book.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 already, but when I went to tell a friend about it I realized you''ve chosen sushi (typically Japanese cuisine) rather than an item from a Chinese menu, which is what I associate this urban legend with. Oh well, no matter, cause this is still a ribbon in my book.', '2006-06-30 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
