(2569760, 354697, 59130, '<td valign="top">Good picture, though how did you keep the clover green with basic editing?  I see your picture has been validated - really interested to know how you did this.  Well done.</td>', 'Good picture, though how did you keep the clover green with basic editing?  I see your picture has been validated - really interested to know how you did this.  Well done.', '2006-06-30 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569769, 354411, 35444, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  Good concept and the separation of which is now an urban legend, isn''t it.  Very creative.  I wish the picture itself was bigger.  I used to submit small pictures too, until I found this: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial link</a>.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yeah!  Good concept and the separation of which is now an urban legend, isn''t it.  Very creative.  I wish the picture itself was bigger.  I used to submit small pictures too, until I found this: tutorial link.  Good luck.', '2006-06-30 14:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569778, 354452, 60223, '<td valign="top">Good attempt but there seems to be something lacking in this photo.  Maybe it''s because the daisies appear to be in a black hole.  I would also like to see more daisies that have been pulled apart to really show that she has spent some time in finding that one that ends with "He loves me".</td>', 'Good attempt but there seems to be something lacking in this photo.  Maybe it''s because the daisies appear to be in a black hole.  I would also like to see more daisies that have been pulled apart to really show that she has spent some time in finding that one that ends with "He loves me".', '2006-06-30 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
