(2569829, 352783, 42100, '<td valign="top">The silky smooth river looks great, the exposure is dead on.  The path of the river as composed, seems to divide the photo and make it rather static.</td>', 'The silky smooth river looks great, the exposure is dead on.  The path of the river as composed, seems to divide the photo and make it rather static.', '2006-06-30 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569831, 352190, 42100, '<td valign="top">The clouds add a sense of mystery to the photos.  However, the dead center placement of the sun(or moon?) leave the photo looking static, without much to keep the eye in the photo.</td>', 'The clouds add a sense of mystery to the photos.  However, the dead center placement of the sun(or moon?) leave the photo looking static, without much to keep the eye in the photo.', '2006-06-30 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569832, 354775, 57519, '<td valign="top">I feel it''s a bit too grainy, although I realize it''s candlelight. I also don''t like the perspective too much. It gives off the feeling the pic is crooked. I think it''s because of the mirror frame.</td>', 'I feel it''s a bit too grainy, although I realize it''s candlelight. I also don''t like the perspective too much. It gives off the feeling the pic is crooked. I think it''s because of the mirror frame.', '2006-06-30 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
