(2569843, 353240, 60223, '<td valign="top">For me, black cats are not that easy to expose for but you have done a wonderful job here in decent light.  I would like to have seen the cat''s right side with a little light to help define him more, as it is now he seems a little off balance being that one side is so dark.  I do love the face and expression on him.</td>', 'For me, black cats are not that easy to expose for but you have done a wonderful job here in decent light.  I would like to have seen the cat''s right side with a little light to help define him more, as it is now he seems a little off balance being that one side is so dark.  I do love the face and expression on him.', '2006-06-30 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569852, 354733, 57519, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the lighting is right and it''s a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I don''t feel the lighting is right and it''s a bit out of focus.', '2006-06-30 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
