(2569881, 354550, 16402, '<td valign="top">I have a lot of trouble seeing how this meets the challenge. While nearly everyone has heard of "hearing the ocean" in a sea shell, that certainly doesn''t make it any kind of superstition and I don''t think that makes it an "urban" (as in city) legend. Still, not a bad studio shot of a shell, I suppose.</td>', 'I have a lot of trouble seeing how this meets the challenge. While nearly everyone has heard of "hearing the ocean" in a sea shell, that certainly doesn''t make it any kind of superstition and I don''t think that makes it an "urban" (as in city) legend. Still, not a bad studio shot of a shell, I suppose.', '2006-06-30 15:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2569885, 354411, 57519, '<td valign="top">You''ll get a lot of comments on your pic being too small. That''s too bad. Hope you found how to make it bigger.</td>', 'You''ll get a lot of comments on your pic being too small. That''s too bad. Hope you found how to make it bigger.', '2006-06-30 15:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
