(2569992, 354688, 22689, '<td valign="top">You are as supersticious as I am ! lol<br/>I really love your patchworks by the way...<br/>It''s a beautiful photo , the cats feel very at ease and the one under the umbrella brings me back many memories...<br/>I like the composition and the black &amp; white choice.<br/>For me , a peaceful scene with beautiful elements.A well deserved 10 !</td>', 'You are as supersticious as I am ! lolI really love your patchworks by the way...It''s a beautiful photo , the cats feel very at ease and the one under the umbrella brings me back many memories...I like the composition and the black & white choice.For me , a peaceful scene with beautiful elements.A well deserved 10 !', '2006-06-30 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
