(2570036, 354316, 22689, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it (I live in Spain) but that doesn''t mean a lower vote.<br/>The photo is excellent with very bright colors and great details.<br/>my vote 8<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-05 03:58:24.</i></td>', 'I don''t get it (I live in Spain) but that doesn''t mean a lower vote.The photo is excellent with very bright colors and great details.my vote 8', '2006-06-30 16:13:02.000000', '2006-07-05 04:58:24.000000', 1),
(2570041, 353125, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t you have to be the one that actually breaks the mirror to have bad luck? :^)  The guy walking is a ways off yet.  I think more impact would be had to have staged him a bit closer like his next step or two was going to make him run into the mirror and ladder.<br/> <br/>As for the image, the B/W theme is good.  The tonal range is flat.  I think some work on contrast and levels may help this image some. JMO of course.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t you have to be the one that actually breaks the mirror to have bad luck? :^)  The guy walking is a ways off yet.  I think more impact would be had to have staged him a bit closer like his next step or two was going to make him run into the mirror and ladder. As for the image, the B/W theme is good.  The tonal range is flat.  I think some work on contrast and levels may help this image some. JMO of course. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-30 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570045, 354342, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s just plain CREEPY!</td>', 'That''s just plain CREEPY!', '2006-06-30 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570046, 353134, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that I''ve ever heard that one before.  ;^)  Makes for an interesting image however.  Overall I like the composition of this, considering the challenge of a square crop.  The angle of the branch works well and having 3 items for a subject generally comes across favorably.  The major disappointment with this image is the focal point is off.  It appears the the petals directly over the large butterfly is in focus, the rest of the image isn''t.  Hard to do I know, but a deeper aperture (depending on distance from subject) may have allowed you to get the large butterfly (at a minumum) and possibly all three, in focus.<br/> <br/>Anyway...best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t know that I''ve ever heard that one before.  ;^)  Makes for an interesting image however.  Overall I like the composition of this, considering the challenge of a square crop.  The angle of the branch works well and having 3 items for a subject generally comes across favorably.  The major disappointment with this image is the focal point is off.  It appears the the petals directly over the large butterfly is in focus, the rest of the image isn''t.  Hard to do I know, but a deeper aperture (depending on distance from subject) may have allowed you to get the large butterfly (at a minumum) and possibly all three, in focus. Anyway...best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-30 16:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570350, 354340, 57519, '<td valign="top">Woah. Look at the eye on that bird! I wonder how you got it so red in basic editing.</td>', 'Woah. Look at the eye on that bird! I wonder how you got it so red in basic editing.', '2006-06-30 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
