(2570521, 352891, 60223, '<td valign="top">Great closeup picture of a shoe!</td>', 'Great closeup picture of a shoe!', '2006-06-30 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570552, 353779, 60223, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the red eye effect.  I also like how the we can see the headstones fade away into the night.  Is there a reason his head was chopped off along the left side?</td>', 'Nice use of the red eye effect.  I also like how the we can see the headstones fade away into the night.  Is there a reason his head was chopped off along the left side?', '2006-06-30 19:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570570, 354218, 60223, '<td valign="top">This is the coolest photo I''ve seen thus far in this category, great job.  Only nitpick which I won''t vote you down for is that the triple shadows make for a dirty spot on the ceiling where they all intersect.</td>', 'This is the coolest photo I''ve seen thus far in this category, great job.  Only nitpick which I won''t vote you down for is that the triple shadows make for a dirty spot on the ceiling where they all intersect.', '2006-06-30 19:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570580, 353551, 60223, '<td valign="top">Someone tell those people they are sitting in the tow-away zone!  Good moment to capture, too bad the kids look so bored.  I would also vote on a thinner crop on both sides so we don''t see the black cushions on the right or the black thing above the guy''s leg.</td>', 'Someone tell those people they are sitting in the tow-away zone!  Good moment to capture, too bad the kids look so bored.  I would also vote on a thinner crop on both sides so we don''t see the black cushions on the right or the black thing above the guy''s leg.', '2006-06-30 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570586, 353419, 60223, '<td valign="top">haha, excellent!  Great framing and tones.</td>', 'haha, excellent!  Great framing and tones.', '2006-06-30 19:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2570747, 353571, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very cool :) and very sharp nice photo :D 9</td>', 'Very cool :) and very sharp nice photo :D 9', '2006-06-30 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
