(2571041, 354674, 29490, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Black child ... hmmm, that doesn''t sound right.  <br/> <br/>Anyway- Loooooovve the expression :)  Nicely photoed!</td>', 'This looks like a Black child ... hmmm, that doesn''t sound right.   Anyway- Loooooovve the expression :)  Nicely photoed!', '2006-06-30 23:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571047, 354185, 61245, '<td valign="top">She should be more scary and it would have the right image :o)</td>', 'She should be more scary and it would have the right image :o)', '2006-06-30 23:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571049, 354211, 61245, '<td valign="top">I love the expression!</td>', 'I love the expression!', '2006-06-30 23:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571117, 354378, 29490, '<td valign="top">I''ve run across a number of these while voting, this is by far the best!  I''m going out of character for a minute and will tell my score:  8.<br/> <br/>Why:  The composition is very good.  Great triangles, great lines, great color on the shoe.<br/> <br/>The only thing I can think to try to make it better is move the intersection of the shoe sole and the crack, put it closer to the ''hotspot'' of 33/66 --- but it might not look good there.  But I babble ...<br/> <br/>I like, great comp, ''nuff said.</td>', 'I''ve run across a number of these while voting, this is by far the best!  I''m going out of character for a minute and will tell my score:  8. Why:  The composition is very good.  Great triangles, great lines, great color on the shoe. The only thing I can think to try to make it better is move the intersection of the shoe sole and the crack, put it closer to the ''hotspot'' of 33/66 --- but it might not look good there.  But I babble ... I like, great comp, ''nuff said.', '2006-06-30 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571134, 354316, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not connecting this to the challenge at all.  Feel free to pm and explain if you wish.</td>', 'I''m not connecting this to the challenge at all.  Feel free to pm and explain if you wish.', '2006-06-30 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571146, 354748, 18799, '<td valign="top">Incredible lightning strike</td>', 'Incredible lightning strike', '2006-06-30 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571167, 353788, 18799, '<td valign="top">A shot in the dark would have done more to emphasize the message.</td>', 'A shot in the dark would have done more to emphasize the message.', '2006-07-01 00:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571174, 354377, 18799, '<td valign="top">Not marking you down for this, but it''s not really a superstition or urban legend.  It''s actually a trueism.  I like the morning (or evening) shot of the lighthouse.  I''m thinking the tree doesn''t add anything to the image and should be cropped out.  8</td>', 'Not marking you down for this, but it''s not really a superstition or urban legend.  It''s actually a trueism.  I like the morning (or evening) shot of the lighthouse.  I''m thinking the tree doesn''t add anything to the image and should be cropped out.  8', '2006-07-01 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571178, 352354, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the legend, but this is a cool shot.  9</td>', 'I don''t know the legend, but this is a cool shot.  9', '2006-07-01 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571179, 354743, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great, creative take on the challenge.  My only nit is the blown highlights in the water which makes me wonder if a different time of day would have been better.  10</td>', 'Great, creative take on the challenge.  My only nit is the blown highlights in the water which makes me wonder if a different time of day would have been better.  10', '2006-07-01 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
