(2571338, 351955, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great idea. IMHO there are a couple of things would make this more interesting. I would have cropped top of the cat so the glass and white block are not visible. The reflection in the broken mirror is a little distracting, and I would have liked to see a better angle on the cat, maybe from a lower level since the angle does not do justice to such a beautiful animal.</td>', 'Great idea. IMHO there are a couple of things would make this more interesting. I would have cropped top of the cat so the glass and white block are not visible. The reflection in the broken mirror is a little distracting, and I would have liked to see a better angle on the cat, maybe from a lower level since the angle does not do justice to such a beautiful animal.', '2006-07-01 00:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
