(2571919, 354719, 54778, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the salt and surface. And not to forget the title<br/>IMO I think you should try with the pic again with a slightly different angle to make the subject even more interesting..:)</td>', 'I like the contrast of the salt and surface. And not to forget the titleIMO I think you should try with the pic again with a slightly different angle to make the subject even more interesting..:)', '2006-07-01 10:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571926, 353449, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feels like a psycho test or something!  ;^)  Tell me what you see...  He-he.</td>', 'Feels like a psycho test or something!  ;^)  Tell me what you see...  He-he.', '2006-07-01 10:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571928, 354290, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words.  Image is interesting.  Couple of things puzzle me about your setup; why the reflector on the floor under her? why not open the ladder all the way?  A white poster board positioned low and angled to your right would bounce light under her if that was the intent.  Just curious...not a big deal really.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice play on words.  Image is interesting.  Couple of things puzzle me about your setup; why the reflector on the floor under her? why not open the ladder all the way?  A white poster board positioned low and angled to your right would bounce light under her if that was the intent.  Just curious...not a big deal really.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-01 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571931, 354153, 30049, '<td valign="top">Look out below!  Hope he doesn''t run into anybody on the beach!  ;^)  I like your choice of B/W here as color would be distracting.  Image is a bit grainy and you''ve gotten some vignetting in the corners.  Composition is very good.  Overall a pleasing image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Look out below!  Hope he doesn''t run into anybody on the beach!  ;^)  I like your choice of B/W here as color would be distracting.  Image is a bit grainy and you''ve gotten some vignetting in the corners.  Composition is very good.  Overall a pleasing image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-01 10:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2571934, 354575, 54778, '<td valign="top">Love the colour contrast</td>', 'Love the colour contrast', '2006-07-01 10:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
