(2572108, 354298, 56673, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Good color and skin tones, nice use of DOF.  Why is the make-up unlucky?</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Good color and skin tones, nice use of DOF.  Why is the make-up unlucky?', '2006-07-01 12:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572114, 354668, 56673, '<td valign="top">That''s one I hadn''t heard of.  When I read "black-eyed peas" I assume it''s a Southern superstition.  Is that right?</td>', 'That''s one I hadn''t heard of.  When I read "black-eyed peas" I assume it''s a Southern superstition.  Is that right?', '2006-07-01 12:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572116, 354430, 56673, '<td valign="top">Oh my - I think he''s dead !  His (or her) eye doesn''t look too good.</td>', 'Oh my - I think he''s dead !  His (or her) eye doesn''t look too good.', '2006-07-01 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572118, 354218, 56673, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is really neat.  Great work creating the ghost-like effect for Mary.  The whole image has a terrific haunted house feel.</td>', 'Wow!  This is really neat.  Great work creating the ghost-like effect for Mary.  The whole image has a terrific haunted house feel.', '2006-07-01 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572120, 352990, 56673, '<td valign="top">I forget why she''s lucky?  Three spots?  Odd number of spots?  Wonderful shot.</td>', 'I forget why she''s lucky?  Three spots?  Odd number of spots?  Wonderful shot.', '2006-07-01 12:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572123, 354153, 56673, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - reminds me of the Wright brothers on the beach.  But a bit of a stretch as a myth.</td>', 'Nice shot - reminds me of the Wright brothers on the beach.  But a bit of a stretch as a myth.', '2006-07-01 12:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572124, 354193, 56673, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Has a real late-night television feel to it.</td>', 'Very nice!  Has a real late-night television feel to it.', '2006-07-01 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572127, 354776, 56673, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  I''ll bet you got security''s attention with this one.</td>', 'Oh my!  I''ll bet you got security''s attention with this one.', '2006-07-01 12:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572133, 354748, 56673, '<td valign="top">I think the size limitations hurt you on this one.  I''ll bet it is spectacular in full size.</td>', 'I think the size limitations hurt you on this one.  I''ll bet it is spectacular in full size.', '2006-07-01 12:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572144, 354290, 56673, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t seem too happy to be under that ladder either, and the squatting pose makes you think she''s about to tinkle.  It took me a while to see the mirror.  Maybe the image would have more appeal if the model had a more mischievous "come hither" look at the camera, like a playful kitten inviting the viewer to join her in some trouble.</td>', 'She doesn''t seem too happy to be under that ladder either, and the squatting pose makes you think she''s about to tinkle.  It took me a while to see the mirror.  Maybe the image would have more appeal if the model had a more mischievous "come hither" look at the camera, like a playful kitten inviting the viewer to join her in some trouble.', '2006-07-01 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572151, 354697, 56673, '<td valign="top">Validated?  I wonder why it would have been challenged.  Is that a real four-leaf clover preserved in glass?  Cool.  Nice crisp image.  Even the chain is sharpened just rght.</td>', 'Validated?  I wonder why it would have been challenged.  Is that a real four-leaf clover preserved in glass?  Cool.  Nice crisp image.  Even the chain is sharpened just rght.', '2006-07-01 12:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572153, 354598, 56673, '<td valign="top">That''s no myth my friend - it''s fact!  My neighbor''s brother-in-law''s cousin told me.</td>', 'That''s no myth my friend - it''s fact!  My neighbor''s brother-in-law''s cousin told me.', '2006-07-01 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572157, 354769, 56673, '<td valign="top">Okay - took me a minute to figure out the urban legend.</td>', 'Okay - took me a minute to figure out the urban legend.', '2006-07-01 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572159, 353419, 56673, '<td valign="top">Hairy palms!  LOL.  4.</td>', 'Hairy palms!  LOL.  4.', '2006-07-01 12:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572163, 354377, 56673, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea - but it looks like the sky didn''t cooperate with you (not very red).  Where is the lighthouse?  I wanted to shoot a lighthouse lens for the "Glass" challenge, but couldn''t find one open to the public anywhere near where I live.</td>', 'I think this is a good idea - but it looks like the sky didn''t cooperate with you (not very red).  Where is the lighthouse?  I wanted to shoot a lighthouse lens for the "Glass" challenge, but couldn''t find one open to the public anywhere near where I live.', '2006-07-01 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572165, 353571, 56673, '<td valign="top">Ewwww.</td>', 'Ewwww.', '2006-07-01 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2572168, 354364, 56673, '<td valign="top">The restorer''s hand pretty much blends into the wall here.  Maybe a different angle or better lighting would help it stand out a bit more to add some depth to the shot.</td>', 'The restorer''s hand pretty much blends into the wall here.  Maybe a different angle or better lighting would help it stand out a bit more to add some depth to the shot.', '2006-07-01 12:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
