(2574811, 354158, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a good legend - nice subject for the challenge.  The lighting is somewhat extreme.  Some fill flash would have brought more detail out in the toad and opened up the deep shadows some.  If possible, set your flash to a negative EV value for a nice fill.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'That''s a good legend - nice subject for the challenge.  The lighting is somewhat extreme.  Some fill flash would have brought more detail out in the toad and opened up the deep shadows some.  If possible, set your flash to a negative EV value for a nice fill.  Best of luck to you.', '2006-07-02 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
