(2575169, 354776, 40718, '<td valign="top">Who''s throwing like a girl?  Repeat after me...from the shoulder...from the shoulder.  Just kidding about that.  It''s a creative idea, although I''d call it more of a proverb than a superstition.  The crutches, I''m sure, are there for a reason, but they are distracting from the picture.  Either ditch the crutches just for the shot, or get her to take the picture while you are throwing the rock (assuming it''s not a self portrait).</td>', 'Who''s throwing like a girl?  Repeat after me...from the shoulder...from the shoulder.  Just kidding about that.  It''s a creative idea, although I''d call it more of a proverb than a superstition.  The crutches, I''m sure, are there for a reason, but they are distracting from the picture.  Either ditch the crutches just for the shot, or get her to take the picture while you are throwing the rock (assuming it''s not a self portrait).', '2006-07-02 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
