(2580825, 354211, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 0/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 0/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3<br/> <br/>Explanation: When I rate an image that is <br/> <br/>below 3, I will offer an explanation.<br/> <br/> <br/>Lighting: The flash is too bright and is too harsh on a subject so close to the camera. It is hard to get detail out of black fur, but is also too reflective for flash so close. The eye colour is blown out due to it being more reflective than anything else, as well some areas on the tongue.<br/>Focus: The image is in focus.<br/>Creativity: Seems more like a snapshot of a funny moment than something meant for a challenge. <br/>Aesthetics: All of the above results in an overall uninteresting photo. It is a funny picture, and got a point for aesthetics because it was a nice "catch" so to speak, of the moment.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 0/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 0/2Aesthetics: 1/3 Explanation: When I rate an image that is  below 3, I will offer an explanation.  Lighting: The flash is too bright and is too harsh on a subject so close to the camera. It is hard to get detail out of black fur, but is also too reflective for flash so close. The eye colour is blown out due to it being more reflective than anything else, as well some areas on the tongue.Focus: The image is in focus.Creativity: Seems more like a snapshot of a funny moment than something meant for a challenge. Aesthetics: All of the above results in an overall uninteresting photo. It is a funny picture, and got a point for aesthetics because it was a nice "catch" so to speak, of the moment.', '2006-07-03 21:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580830, 354738, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3<br/> <br/>The ring is a little blown out as far as brightness/exposure is concerned. If it weren''t for that I would have rated perfect for lighting, and 2 for aesthetics. Focus could have been a bit sharper on the chain for the ring.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3 The ring is a little blown out as far as brightness/exposure is concerned. If it weren''t for that I would have rated perfect for lighting, and 2 for aesthetics. Focus could have been a bit sharper on the chain for the ring.', '2006-07-03 21:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580840, 354697, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 2/2<br/>Focus: 2/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3<br/> <br/>I would have rated this photo an 8 or a 9 if it weren''t for the desaturation of everything but green. It''s a good use of the technique, but I don''t like it at all, which is what resulted in the low aesthetics score. This is a personal preference, however.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 2/2Focus: 2/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3 I would have rated this photo an 8 or a 9 if it weren''t for the desaturation of everything but green. It''s a good use of the technique, but I don''t like it at all, which is what resulted in the low aesthetics score. This is a personal preference, however.', '2006-07-03 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580848, 354282, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3<br/> <br/>Hopefully there are no fish or other wildlife living in that water. Most aquatic life are harmed by the metals leeched into the water over time. Aquatic snails in particular will die if there are any traces of copper.<br/> <br/>The exposure is a bit blown out on the reflection of some coins, but aside from that it was okay. Lighting is a bit flat, but a decent photo anyways. Everyone likes to see a splash :-)</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3 Hopefully there are no fish or other wildlife living in that water. Most aquatic life are harmed by the metals leeched into the water over time. Aquatic snails in particular will die if there are any traces of copper. The exposure is a bit blown out on the reflection of some coins, but aside from that it was okay. Lighting is a bit flat, but a decent photo anyways. Everyone likes to see a splash :-)', '2006-07-03 21:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580854, 351674, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 2/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3<br/> <br/>I don''t usually like attempts at humour in the caption of a photo, but it works in this case. I gave a point in creativity for making me chuckle. Lighting is fine, but it seems like the squirrel could be a LITTLE sharper. Not a huge deal at this size, however. Overall really good.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 2/2Aesthetics: 2/3 I don''t usually like attempts at humour in the caption of a photo, but it works in this case. I gave a point in creativity for making me chuckle. Lighting is fine, but it seems like the squirrel could be a LITTLE sharper. Not a huge deal at this size, however. Overall really good.', '2006-07-03 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1);
