(2580883, 352987, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 0/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 2/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3<br/> <br/>Would have received a better score if the daisy and hands were not a little blown out with exposure. Best example of this "urban myth" so far.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 0/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 2/2Aesthetics: 2/3 Would have received a better score if the daisy and hands were not a little blown out with exposure. Best example of this "urban myth" so far.', '2006-07-03 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2580904, 354660, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 0/1<br/>Lighting: 2/2<br/>Focus: 2/2<br/>Creativity: 0/2<br/>Aesthetics: 3/3<br/> <br/>I wasn''t convinced that this was a good entry for this myth. To me, it''s more of a photo of lighting, and nothing to identify with the legend aside from that. That''s just my opinion though, and I gave you the benefit of the doubt and rated it according to other factors. For a photo I don''t think fits, quite a nice score :-) All other factors were quite perfect for a lighting photo.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 0/1Lighting: 2/2Focus: 2/2Creativity: 0/2Aesthetics: 3/3 I wasn''t convinced that this was a good entry for this myth. To me, it''s more of a photo of lighting, and nothing to identify with the legend aside from that. That''s just my opinion though, and I gave you the benefit of the doubt and rated it according to other factors. For a photo I don''t think fits, quite a nice score :-) All other factors were quite perfect for a lighting photo.', '2006-07-03 21:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
