(2582237, 354290, 28494, '<td valign="top">Excellent twist on the three old superstitions, however it would have been far more effective had your model been facing the camera and making eye contact with the camera. That would improve the shot from a 7 to a 9 at least. <br/> <br/>Also, good on you for tackling more than one theme at a time! Great work.</td>', 'Excellent twist on the three old superstitions, however it would have been far more effective had your model been facing the camera and making eye contact with the camera. That would improve the shot from a 7 to a 9 at least.  Also, good on you for tackling more than one theme at a time! Great work.', '2006-07-04 04:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
