(2587603, 354598, 46314, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the comments.<br/> <br/>It could have been a better shot, but given the constraints of resources and time I faced on this one, I''m still happy with the way the image came out: I managed to shoot it just the way I saw it in my head.<br/> <br/>I agree with the comments about the distracting texture of the towel and the slight patches of yellow in the top left corner. Unfortunately I didn''t have much choice. That''s the only makeshift white backdrop I could come up with.<br/>That''s also the reason it''s a bit overexposed, and why I cropped it so tight at the top - all done to try minimize the texture of the towel showing up in the photo.<br/>Also, I should have paid more attention to the focussing. That soft patch on the shoulder of the can really bothers me...</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the comments. It could have been a better shot, but given the constraints of resources and time I faced on this one, I''m still happy with the way the image came out: I managed to shoot it just the way I saw it in my head. I agree with the comments about the distracting texture of the towel and the slight patches of yellow in the top left corner. Unfortunately I didn''t have much choice. That''s the only makeshift white backdrop I could come up with.That''s also the reason it''s a bit overexposed, and why I cropped it so tight at the top - all done to try minimize the texture of the towel showing up in the photo.Also, I should have paid more attention to the focussing. That soft patch on the shoulder of the can really bothers me...', '2006-07-05 11:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2587639, 354676, 18339, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent picture, Congratulations!</td>', 'Wow, excellent picture, Congratulations!', '2006-07-05 12:01:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2587666, 353571, 28710, '<td valign="top">Heh. I''ve not actually eaten it (I feel that dogs are much too dirty to be worth eating), I''ve seen dog meat... It''s a very red meat...<br/> <br/>Koreans and Chinese are the biggest consumers of dogs... Sushi is considered a much ''higher brow'' meal made from high quality cuts of much more expensive meats.<br/> <br/>They say that Black is the best tasting, followed by multi-colored then yellow... Some people have different views.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Heh. I''ve not actually eaten it (I feel that dogs are much too dirty to be worth eating), I''ve seen dog meat... It''s a very red meat... Koreans and Chinese are the biggest consumers of dogs... Sushi is considered a much ''higher brow'' meal made from high quality cuts of much more expensive meats. They say that Black is the best tasting, followed by multi-colored then yellow... Some people have different views. ', '2006-07-05 12:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2587676, 354290, 28710, '<td valign="top">Heh, I''m a little surprised at the age of the shooter here... Not so much that she would think of taking this or that she would do such an amazing job of it, but more that she would be aware of such curious items that mum owns...<br/> <br/>I wouldn''t be surprised if Dr Jones came by and gave a little nod...</td>', 'Heh, I''m a little surprised at the age of the shooter here... Not so much that she would think of taking this or that she would do such an amazing job of it, but more that she would be aware of such curious items that mum owns... I wouldn''t be surprised if Dr Jones came by and gave a little nod...', '2006-07-05 12:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
