(2587931, 354676, 25397, '<td valign="top">So glad you chose a centered composition, I think people are so cracked up on ''rules of thirds'' anything that doesn''t have it seems wrong to them. It''s mystical admist all this scenary. <br/> <br/>I really dig that lighting look you get with the bowens too, really professional. <br/> <br/>Congrats</td>', 'So glad you chose a centered composition, I think people are so cracked up on ''rules of thirds'' anything that doesn''t have it seems wrong to them. It''s mystical admist all this scenary.  I really dig that lighting look you get with the bowens too, really professional.  Congrats', '2006-07-05 13:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2587943, 354196, 32293, '<td valign="top"><i>text</i> <br/>This is beautifully captured.<br/>To many would allow the focus to be on the shamrocks as well as the stone.<br/>You''ve positioned it nicely to pick up a bit of the green reflection,  also allowing the sky blue to be picked up as well, and wonderful soft lighting.<br/>I love the composition and framing you did as well.</td>', 'text This is beautifully captured.To many would allow the focus to be on the shamrocks as well as the stone.You''ve positioned it nicely to pick up a bit of the green reflection,  also allowing the sky blue to be picked up as well, and wonderful soft lighting.I love the composition and framing you did as well.', '2006-07-05 13:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
