(2590147, 351989, 50127, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to add... The photo wasn''t supposed to represent a specific superstition, but encompass many superstitions that surround crows/ravens/blackbirds.  Most of those superstitions include the bird being a messanger, bringer of bad tidings, etc.  So I liked the title for that reason (not to mention Poe is awesome)... Didnt have much choice about the background, Grackie goes where he pleases and this was the best out of about 50 photos.  The color version was not good at all, there was a lot of greenish dying grass that just caught your eye before anything else.<br/> <br/>Also, the tail is cropped out because its reallllllly long and the composition did not look right when it was included.</td>', 'Just wanted to add... The photo wasn''t supposed to represent a specific superstition, but encompass many superstitions that surround crows/ravens/blackbirds.  Most of those superstitions include the bird being a messanger, bringer of bad tidings, etc.  So I liked the title for that reason (not to mention Poe is awesome)... Didnt have much choice about the background, Grackie goes where he pleases and this was the best out of about 50 photos.  The color version was not good at all, there was a lot of greenish dying grass that just caught your eye before anything else. Also, the tail is cropped out because its reallllllly long and the composition did not look right when it was included.', '2006-07-05 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 0),
