(2610714, 353216, 22781, '<td valign="top">Critique club Comment,<br/> <br/>Hi from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>You know I only heard of Bloody Mary a few weeks ago, I guess its not a legend here in Europe. I saw an episode of the TV series Supernatural that had this legend in it, and guess what, it worked there, she really came!<br/> <br/>Youve seen that the idea was good, because one of the bloody Mary photos in this challenge ribboned. But you also placed very well, congratulations.<br/> <br/>There is not much I can say to improve this picture. I can tell you that normaly I am afraid to enter bad vibe pictures like this, because some people will vote you down, so I think its very brave.<br/> <br/>1 little thing is that I would have liked to see the 2nd eye in the picture.<br/> <br/>All in all a very good photo,<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Peter<br/></td>', 'Critique club Comment, Hi from the Critique Club. You know I only heard of Bloody Mary a few weeks ago, I guess its not a legend here in Europe. I saw an episode of the TV series Supernatural that had this legend in it, and guess what, it worked there, she really came! Youve seen that the idea was good, because one of the bloody Mary photos in this challenge ribboned. But you also placed very well, congratulations. There is not much I can say to improve this picture. I can tell you that normaly I am afraid to enter bad vibe pictures like this, because some people will vote you down, so I think its very brave. 1 little thing is that I would have liked to see the 2nd eye in the picture. All in all a very good photo, Keep up the good work. Peter', '2006-07-11 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 0),
