(2612641, 352018, 42567, '<td valign="top">*** Greetings from the Critique Club ***<br/> <br/>First off, I think this is a great picture.  Very nice colors and nice sky.  A bit blown out sky but not really bad IMO.   I''m having a hard time understand the title with the picture which I''m sure you lost some points with the voters there.<br/> <br/>Your focus is good and detail is great!  Lamp post is a bit bothering.  I''m sure if it was advance editing you would have removed it.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.  Your scores will improve!<br/> <br/>Phillip<br/> <br/></td>', '*** Greetings from the Critique Club *** First off, I think this is a great picture.  Very nice colors and nice sky.  A bit blown out sky but not really bad IMO.   I''m having a hard time understand the title with the picture which I''m sure you lost some points with the voters there. Your focus is good and detail is great!  Lamp post is a bit bothering.  I''m sure if it was advance editing you would have removed it. Keep up the good work.  Your scores will improve! Phillip ', '2006-07-12 00:12:58.000000', NULL, 0),
