(2642799, 354598, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You''re like the McGuyver of photography: "all I had was a camera and a coke can and a crappy towel, so the best I could do was 6/93."<br/> <br/>I love that you told us how you did it, because it gives the rest of us hope that we can cobble together stuff that looks good, too.<br/> <br/>As of right now, my "studio" consists of one piece of white poster board, one piece of black poster board, and ... that''s it.  Oh, and whatever books, tupperware, and stuff I can find that my wife makes me put back when I''m finished. :)</td>', 'Wow.  You''re like the McGuyver of photography: "all I had was a camera and a coke can and a crappy towel, so the best I could do was 6/93." I love that you told us how you did it, because it gives the rest of us hope that we can cobble together stuff that looks good, too. As of right now, my "studio" consists of one piece of white poster board, one piece of black poster board, and ... that''s it.  Oh, and whatever books, tupperware, and stuff I can find that my wife makes me put back when I''m finished. :)', '2006-07-20 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
